/*

	Most of the structures used in here are database tables, they could
	be easily represented by 'field' arrays.

	cons --	potentially destroys cache coherency,
			removes the object oriented nature.

	pros --	removes class allocation overhead on large databases
			could lead to a general indexed property system.

*/

